      "fontSize": 19,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "A stalled EA run occupies a worker slot.\nIf the backend restarts or a run times out, a tool action may\nhave happened without a recorded final outcome.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A stalled EA run occupies a worker slot.\nIf the backend restarts or a run times out, a tool action may have happened without a recorded final outcome.",
