      "seed": 1690695207,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 271922565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794897957,
      "created": 1794794897957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 7,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- The upstream renderer exposes the complete roster: 1,000 or 10,000 saved EA names. This fork returns at most 30 search candidates, ten per page.\n- Before counts are reproduced using upstream 5b5f635; after counts come from the saved offline retrieval benchmark, twelve repeats per directory size.\n- Roster entries and search candidates contain different fields. This is a directory-exposure comparison, not a measured total-token, accuracy, or speed improvement.\n- Recent task links and other IA context are outside the chart. Local search computation still increases with directory size.\n- Source: docs/charts/measurements.json and docs/charts/README.md."
      },
      "name": "08 — IA roster exposure"
    },
    {
      "id": "IWR2DDaksKDLMac2t3gDz",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 13076,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1934647751,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 554078539,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794898016,
      "created": 1794794898016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 8,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- At 100 synthetic completed exchanges, upstream loads 59,459 estimated context tokens; the bounded context builder loads 4,529.\n- These estimates use the application's conservative character fallback plus a 15% safety margin. They exclude static system instructions and the next incoming request; they are not provider-reported usage.\n- Both implementations receive identical synthetic exchanges with one 60-line tool result each. Upstream natively retains only the first 500 characters of each tool result.\n- The new view contains task identity and the two most recent completed exchanges. No summary model runs in this fixture; all 100 full tool results remain in the journal.\n- The dashed line is the configured 8,000-token saved-context budget. Numeric x spacing follows completed exchange counts.\n- Source: docs/charts/measurements.json, tests/evaluation/measure_overload.py, and docs/charts/README.md."
      },
      "name": "09 — EA history context"
    },
